  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\n**Given: **46, 93, 188, 379, 764, 1529\n\n⇒ 46 × 2 + 1 = 92 + 1 = 93\n\n⇒ 93 × 2 + 2 = 186 + 2 = 188\n\n⇒ 188 × 2 + 3 = 376 + 3 = 379\n\n⇒ 379 × 2 + 4 = 758 + 4 = **762 ≠ 764**\n\n⇒ 762 × 2 + 5 = 1524 + 5 = 1529\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"764\".**",
